      "text": "Suspend Message Background (Rengoku-hen)",
      "status": "draft",
      "source_sha": "e51c6ecd1c",
      "source_member_sha256": "24f6994e8fb1f46c94ab69b597a85c32ef849c18da2088efb1c5b03aaa922b3c",
      "notes": []
    },
    "rengoku:STGZ3REN_00114:00002": {
      "text": "Suspend Message Background (Rengoku-hen)",
      "status": "draft",
      "source_sha": "e51c6ecd1c",
      "source_member_sha256": "24f6994e8fb1f46c94ab69b597a85c32ef849c18da2088efb1c5b03aaa922b3c",
      "notes": []
    },
    "rengoku:STGZ3REN_00114:00003": {
      "text": "$$クラヴィア$$\n「Wah!\n　M-me, greeting the players!?」",
      "status": "draft",
      "source_sha": "ce47627132",
      "source_member_sha256": "24f6994e8fb1f46c94ab69b597a85c32ef849c18da2088efb1c5b03aaa922b3c",
      "notes": [
        "\"Wah!\" for はわ！ (flustered interjection); no established glossary rendering."
      ]
    },
    "rengoku:STGZ3REN_00114:00004": {
      "text": "$$クラヴィア$$\n「Um... let's see... that is... I'm not\n　really sure what to say at a time like this, but...」",
      "status": "draft",
      "source_sha": "d5b9315b96",
      "source_member_sha256": "24f6994e8fb1f46c94ab69b597a85c32ef849c18da2088efb1c5b03aaa922b3c",
      "notes": []
    },
    "rengoku:STGZ3REN_00114:00005": {
      "text": "$$クラヴィア$$\n「Please look forward to the main story,\n　『Tengoku-hen』, too!」",
      "status": "draft",
      "source_sha": "c4604edbc0",
      "source_member_sha256": "24f6994e8fb1f46c94ab69b597a85c32ef849c18da2088efb1c5b03aaa922b3c",
      "notes": []
    },
    "rengoku:STGZ3REN_00114:00006": {
      "text": "$$クラヴィア$$\n「...I don't know if I'll get to appear in it, but...」",
      "status": "draft",
      "source_sha": "2604d1fbf1",
      "source_member_sha256": "24f6994e8fb1f46c94ab69b597a85c32ef849c18da2088efb1c5b03aaa922b3c",
      "notes": []
    },
    "rengoku:STGZ3REN_00114:00007": {
      "text": "Suspend Message Background (Rengoku-hen)",
      "status": "draft",
      "source_sha": "e51c6ecd1c",
      "source_member_sha256": "24f6994e8fb1f46c94ab69b597a85c32ef849c18da2088efb1c5b03aaa922b3c",
      "notes": []
    },
    "rengoku:STGZ3REN_00114:00008": {
      "text": "Suspend Message Background (Rengoku-hen)",
      "status": "draft",
      "source_sha": "e51c6ecd1c",
      "source_member_sha256": "24f6994e8fb1f46c94ab69b597a85c32ef849c18da2088efb1c5b03aaa922b3c",
      "notes": []
    },
    "rengoku:STGZ3REN_00114:00009": {
      "text": "Suspend Message Background (Rengoku-hen)",
      "status": "draft",
      "source_sha": "e51c6ecd1c",
      "source_member_sha256": "24f6994e8fb1f46c94ab69b597a85c32ef849c18da2088efb1c5b03aaa922b3c",
      "notes": []
    },
    "rengoku:STGZ3REN_00114:00010": {
      "text": "$$ランド$$\n「Eeeh, your ever-familiar wandering repair shop,\n　famous for sincere service and employee smiles,\n　$$ビーター・サービス$$, here we goooo」",
      "status": "draft",
      "source_sha": "227c2c001d",
      "source_member_sha256": "24f6994e8fb1f46c94ab69b597a85c32ef849c18da2088efb1c5b03aaa922b3c",
      "notes": []
    },
    "rengoku:STGZ3REN_00114:00011": {
      "text": "$$メール$$\n「Today, our company would like to offer\n　the players some advice on how to\n　get along well with your game console」",
      "status": "draft",
      "source_sha": "256781995d",
      "source_member_sha256": "24f6994e8fb1f46c94ab69b597a85c32ef849c18da2088efb1c5b03aaa922b3c",
      "notes": []
    },
    "rengoku:STGZ3REN_00114:00012": {
      "text": "$$メール$$\n「And that is, quite simply...!」",
      "status": "draft",
      "source_sha": "2414672ac0",
      "source_member_sha256": "24f6994e8fb1f46c94ab69b597a85c32ef849c18da2088efb1c5b03aaa922b3c",
      "notes": []
    },
    "rengoku:STGZ3REN_00114:00013": {
      "text": "$$ランド$$\n「\"Love\"!\n　The relationship between machine and human\n　comes down to that one word!」",
      "status": "draft",
      "source_sha": "050bbe8679",
      "source_member_sha256": "24f6994e8fb1f46c94ab69b597a85c32ef849c18da2088efb1c5b03aaa922b3c",
      "notes": []
    },
    "rengoku:STGZ3REN_00114:00014": {
      "text": "$$メール$$\n「...Darling,\n　the $$ガンレオン$$ seems to be acting up...」",
      "status": "draft",
      "source_sha": "f41e7baeaf",
      "source_member_sha256": "24f6994e8fb1f46c94ab69b597a85c32ef849c18da2088efb1c5b03aaa922b3c",
      "notes": []
    },
    "rengoku:STGZ3REN_00114:00015": {
      "text": "$$ランド$$\n「At times like that, you chop the console\n　at a 45-degree angle to the right,\n　with all your might!!」",
      "status": "draft",
      "source_sha": "10ba246860",
      "source_member_sha256": "24f6994e8fb1f46c94ab69b597a85c32ef849c18da2088efb1c5b03aaa922b3c",
      "notes": []
    },
    "rengoku:STGZ3REN_00114:00016": {
      "text": "$$メール$$\n「...That was a bad example. Please take good care of\n　your game consoles, everyone」",
      "status": "draft",
      "source_sha": "0216fecb12",
      "source_member_sha256": "24f6994e8fb1f46c94ab69b597a85c32ef849c18da2088efb1c5b03aaa922b3c",
      "notes": [
        "Build019: measured dialogue reflow; speaker, wrappers, links and word order preserved."
      ]
    },
    "rengoku:STGZ3REN_00114:00017": {
      "text": "$$ランド$$\n「Well then, see you around!」",
      "status": "draft",
      "source_sha": "949360c895",
      "source_member_sha256": "24f6994e8fb1f46c94ab69b597a85c32ef849c18da2088efb1c5b03aaa922b3c",
      "notes": []
    },
    "rengoku:STGZ3REN_00114:00018": {
      "text": "Suspend Message Background (Rengoku-hen)",
      "status": "draft",
      "source_sha": "e51c6ecd1c",
      "source_member_sha256": "24f6994e8fb1f46c94ab69b597a85c32ef849c18da2088efb1c5b03aaa922b3c",
      "notes": []
    },
    "rengoku:STGZ3REN_00114:00019": {
      "text": "Suspend Message Background (Rengoku-hen)",
      "status": "draft",
      "source_sha": "e51c6ecd1c",
      "source_member_sha256": "24f6994e8fb1f46c94ab69b597a85c32ef849c18da2088efb1c5b03aaa922b3c",
      "notes": []
    },
    "rengoku:STGZ3REN_00114:00020": {
      "text": "Suspend Message Background (Rengoku-hen)",
      "status": "draft",
      "source_sha": "e51c6ecd1c",
      "source_member_sha256": "24f6994e8fb1f46c94ab69b597a85c32ef849c18da2088efb1c5b03aaa922b3c",
      "notes": []
    },
    "rengoku:STGZ3REN_00114:00021": {
      "text": "$$クロウ$$\n「Hey... good work out there.\n　Let's call it a day here」",
      "status": "draft",
      "source_sha": "b2bb2b0161",
      "source_member_sha256": "24f6994e8fb1f46c94ab69b597a85c32ef849c18da2088efb1c5b03aaa922b3c",
      "notes": []
    },
    "rengoku:STGZ3REN_00114:00022": {
      "text": "$$クロウ$$\n「So, I've got a favor to ask...\n　could you spare a little of the machine\n　upgrade budget for me personally?」",
      "status": "draft",
      "source_sha": "3171b4a9c4",
      "source_member_sha256": "24f6994e8fb1f46c94ab69b597a85c32ef849c18da2088efb1c5b03aaa922b3c",
      "notes": []
    },
    "rengoku:STGZ3REN_00114:00023": {
      "text": "$$クロウ$$\n「Lately the $$チーフ$$'s been hard on me,\n　saying the data I bring in isn't up to snuff」",
      "status": "draft",
      "source_sha": "ccd1e2f633",
      "source_member_sha256": "24f6994e8fb1f46c94ab69b597a85c32ef849c18da2088efb1c5b03aaa922b3c",
      "notes": []
    },
    "rengoku:STGZ3REN_00114:00024": {
      "text": "$$クロウ$$\n「What? You can't use the whole squad's\n　funds on something like that?\n　...Fair enough」",
      "status": "draft",
      "source_sha": "69d74b1bb8",
      "source_member_sha256": "24f6994e8fb1f46c94ab69b597a85c32ef849c18da2088efb1c5b03aaa922b3c",
      "notes": []
    },
    "rengoku:STGZ3REN_00114:00025": {
      "text": "$$クロウ$$\n「Then let me shine next time you play.\n　I'm counting on you, partner」",
      "status": "draft",
      "source_sha": "59bee00ad0",
      "source_member_sha256": "24f6994e8fb1f46c94ab69b597a85c32ef849c18da2088efb1c5b03aaa922b3c",
      "notes": []
    },
    "rengoku:STGZ3REN_00114:00026": {
      "text": "Suspend Message Background (Rengoku-hen)",
      "status": "draft",
      "source_sha": "e51c6ecd1c",
      "source_member_sha256": "24f6994e8fb1f46c94ab69b597a85c32ef849c18da2088efb1c5b03aaa922b3c",
      "notes": []
    },
    "rengoku:STGZ3REN_00114:00027": {
      "text": "Suspend Message Background (Rengoku-hen)",
      "status": "draft",
      "source_sha": "e51c6ecd1c",
      "source_member_sha256": "24f6994e8fb1f46c94ab69b597a85c32ef849c18da2088efb1c5b03aaa922b3c",
      "notes": []
    },
    "rengoku:STGZ3REN_00114:00028": {
      "text": "Suspend Message Background (Rengoku-hen)",
      "status": "draft",
      "source_sha": "e51c6ecd1c",
      "source_member_sha256": "24f6994e8fb1f46c94ab69b597a85c32ef849c18da2088efb1c5b03aaa922b3c",
      "notes": []
    },
    "rengoku:STGZ3REN_00114:00029": {
      "text": "$$セツコ$$\n「Thank you for your hard work, everyone.\n　Please get some good rest」",
      "status": "draft",
      "source_sha": "852c4cacc7",
      "source_member_sha256": "24f6994e8fb1f46c94ab69b597a85c32ef849c18da2088efb1c5b03aaa922b3c",
      "notes": []
    },
    "rengoku:STGZ3REN_00114:00030": {
      "text": "$$セツコ$$\n「I'm a little tired too, so I think I'll\n　have something sweet and take a break」",
      "status": "draft",
      "source_sha": "1476900fc0",
      "source_member_sha256": "24f6994e8fb1f46c94ab69b597a85c32ef849c18da2088efb1c5b03aaa922b3c",
      "notes": []
    },
    "rengoku:STGZ3REN_00114:00031": {
      "text": "$$セツコ$$\n「Did you know? Chocolate actually goes well with\n　beer」",
      "status": "draft",
      "source_sha": "4eff052559",
      "source_member_sha256": "24f6994e8fb1f46c94ab69b597a85c32ef849c18da2088efb1c5b03aaa922b3c",
      "notes": [
        "Build019: measured dialogue reflow; speaker, wrappers, links and word order preserved."
      ]
    },
    "rengoku:STGZ3REN_00114:00032": {
      "text": "$$セツコ$$\n「I'll be careful not to drink too much\n　and end up with regrets.\n　Well then, everyone... let's meet again」",
      "status": "draft",
      "source_sha": "925f7684c7",
      "source_member_sha256": "24f6994e8fb1f46c94ab69b597a85c32ef849c18da2088efb1c5b03aaa922b3c",
      "notes": []
    },
    "rengoku:STGZ3REN_00114:00033": {
      "text": "Suspend Message Background (Rengoku-hen)",
      "status": "draft",
      "source_sha": "e51c6ecd1c",
      "source_member_sha256": "24f6994e8fb1f46c94ab69b597a85c32ef849c18da2088efb1c5b03aaa922b3c",
      "notes": []
    },
    "rengoku:STGZ3REN_00114:00034": {
      "text": "Suspend Message Background (Rengoku-hen)",
      "status": "draft",
      "source_sha": "e51c6ecd1c",
      "source_member_sha256": "24f6994e8fb1f46c94ab69b597a85c32ef849c18da2088efb1c5b03aaa922b3c",
      "notes": []
    },
    "rengoku:STGZ3REN_00114:00035": {
      "text": "Suspend Message Background (Rengoku-hen)",
      "status": "draft",
      "source_sha": "e51c6ecd1c",
      "source_member_sha256": "24f6994e8fb1f46c94ab69b597a85c32ef849c18da2088efb1c5b03aaa922b3c",
      "notes": []
    },
    "rengoku:STGZ3REN_00114:00036": {
      "text": "$$アドヴェント$$\n「Greetings, players. My name is $$アドヴェント$$...\n　a watcher over humanity's evolution,\n　field commander of the $$クロノ$$」",
      "status": "draft",
      "source_sha": "c29a21cf0d",
      "source_member_sha256": "24f6994e8fb1f46c94ab69b597a85c32ef849c18da2088efb1c5b03aaa922b3c",
      "notes": []
    },
    "rengoku:STGZ3REN_00114:00037": {
      "text": "$$アドヴェント$$\n「Ha... I usually stay in the shadow\n　of human history, so being pulled out\n　into a place like this troubles me somewhat...」",
      "status": "draft",
      "source_sha": "47b8ad35d3",
      "source_member_sha256": "24f6994e8fb1f46c94ab69b597a85c32ef849c18da2088efb1c5b03aaa922b3c",
      "notes": []
    },
    "rengoku:STGZ3REN_00114:00038": {
      "text": "$$アドヴェント$$\n「Well then, as one who knows what lies ahead,\n　let me give you some useful information.\n　Guiding you is also a joy of mine」",
      "status": "draft",
      "source_sha": "13234ba2c2",
      "source_member_sha256": "24f6994e8fb1f46c94ab69b597a85c32ef849c18da2088efb1c5b03aaa922b3c",
      "notes": []
    },
    "rengoku:STGZ3REN_00114:00039": {
      "text": "$$アドヴェント$$\n「Link the clear data from this 『Rengoku-hen』 to\n　『Tengoku-hen』, and something good will happen」",
      "status": "draft",
      "source_sha": "0face1a8d6",
      "source_member_sha256": "24f6994e8fb1f46c94ab69b597a85c32ef849c18da2088efb1c5b03aaa922b3c",
      "notes": [
        "『連獄篇』/『天獄篇』 rendered as the established romanized titles Rengoku-hen/Tengoku-hen (per AGENTS.md, this is NPJB00689 Rengoku-hen; Tengoku-hen is the paired Z3 volume), kept in 『』 per convention rather than as $$...$$ glossary keys.",
        "Build019: measured dialogue reflow; speaker, wrappers, links and word order preserved."
      ]
    },
    "rengoku:STGZ3REN_00114:00040": {
      "text": "$$アドヴェント$$\n「But there's no need to rush through it.\n　You can link your 『Rengoku-hen』 clear data\n　even partway through 『Tengoku-hen』」",
      "status": "draft",
      "source_sha": "88c08d2736",
      "source_member_sha256": "24f6994e8fb1f46c94ab69b597a85c32ef849c18da2088efb1c5b03aaa922b3c",
      "notes": [
        "Same Rengoku-hen/Tengoku-hen title rendering as 00039."
      ]
    },
    "rengoku:STGZ3REN_00114:00041": {
      "text": "$$アドヴェント$$\n「Well then, I'll be waiting for you\n　at the far end of myth.\n　See you again!」",
      "status": "draft",
      "source_sha": "baeef0a88f",
      "source_member_sha256": "24f6994e8fb1f46c94ab69b597a85c32ef849c18da2088efb1c5b03aaa922b3c",
      "notes": []
    }
  }
}
